sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AI as AI Agent
    participant SB as Sandbox (core, C)
    participant K as Linux Kernel
    participant M as Monitor (Rust)
    participant MCP as MCP Server (TS)

    AI->>SB: exec generated code
    SB->>K: syscall e.g. socket()
    K-->>K: Seccomp-BPF filter hit
    K--xSB: SIGSYS / NOTIFY
    K->>M: seccomp_unotify fd event
    M->>M: lookup syscall_feedback.json
    M->>MCP: semantic event {syscall, action, msg}
    MCP-->>AI: "Action Denied: restricted network call"
    AI->>SB: retry with corrected code
